    {"type":"line","id":"div3","x":40,"y":1364,"width":1560,"height":0,"points":[[0,0],[1560,0]],"strokeColor":"#64748b","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"dashed","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"seed":235015},
    {"type":"text","id":"pat_h","x":40,"y":1380,"width":400,"height":15,"strokeColor":"#93c5fd","text":"PATTERNS IT INSTANCES","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":236001},
    {"type":"text","id":"pat_t","x":40,"y":1402,"width":1560,"height":45,"strokeColor":"#94a3b8","text":"[06] Calibrated Degrees of Freedom: inventory is code, not prose, which is right for a check repeated across every role, but the code checks the wrong thing: repeatable, yet blind to values\n[17] Blast-Radius Gating: components that need host access are recorded as exceptions instead of being forced non-root\n[19] Scope Lock and Checkpoint Delivery: it seeds workstream C's scope at scope lock, yet never applies the one boundary that scope depends on: owned roles only","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":236002},
    {"type":"text","id":"missing","x":40,"y":1462,"width":1560,"height":45,"strokeColor":"#fecaca","text":"deliberately missing: reading values (the required value of each field is known: non-root true, escalation false, read-only true, every capability dropped; one line per field)\n· the container as the unit, so a plan can say which one is exposed · an ownership input: the list the user decides at scope lock\n· one exception list, in one file, that the script, the guide and the subagent all read","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":236003},
    {"type":"text","id":"proto","x":40,"y":1522,"width":1560,"height":30,"strokeColor":"#94a3b8","text":"prototype: a fabricated roles tree scanned twice, once by word search and once by value, per container, over owned roles only · exits 1 on the three roles where the two disagree\nin the prototype: container blocks found by line patterns, not a YAML parser · no fix-type guess · nothing written to disk","fontSize":12,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"left","verticalAlign":"top","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"lineHeight":1.25,"autoResize":false,"seed":236004}
  ],
